      "description": "Diagrammatic representation of the Watten bunker complex. According to Roland Hautefeuille: Constructions Spéciales - Histoire de la construction par l'organisation Todt dans le Pas-de-Calais et le Cotentin, des neufs grands sites protégés pour le tir des V1, V2, V3 et la production d'oxygène liquide. (1943-1944). Auteur-Éditeur R. Hautefeuille, Paris 1995, ISBN 2-9500899-0-9. Pages 36/37.\nFortified train station for missile and supplies delivery.\nLiquid oxygen storage.\nTransit halls.\nServicing hall where the V-2s would be prepared for launch.\nLiquid oxygen production plant.\nTransit halls where V-2s would be transported to the launch pads\nLaunch pads\nLaunch control centre\nStandard gauge rail link to Calais-Saint-Omer railway line.",
